WEBVTT

NOTE Senate closed-caption track (master/text_1.m3u8), roll-up lines collapsed; times are clip seconds (stream - 5318). Captions lag speech by a few seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
DECISION ON MY OWN, CONSULTING

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.700
WITH MY STAFF, AND REVIEWING THE

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.200
INCREDIBLY STRONG EVIDENCE THAT

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.600
WE ACCURATE.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.300
SEN. KENNEDY: IN FACT, PRESIDENT

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.100
BIDEN AND/OR HIS WHITE HOUSE

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.400
STAFF TOLD GENERAL GARLAND TO

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.200
PROSECUTE THE PRESIDENT, DIDN'T

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.600
HE?

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.300
MR. SMITH: AGAIN, I HAVE NO IDEA

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:18.900
ABOUT THAT.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.400
WHAT MY JOB WAS --

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.500
SEN. KENNEDY: DON'T KNOW

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:21.800
ANYTHING ABOUT THAT.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.600
DO YOU BELIEVE IN THE TOOTH

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.200
FAIRY?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.200
MR. SMITH: I DO NOT.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.200
SEN. KENNEDY: HOW ABOUT THE

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.500
EASTER BUNNY?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.900
MR. SMITH: I NO LONGER BELIEVE

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.300
IN THE EASTER BUNNY.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.300
SEN. KENNEDY: DO YOU THINK JIMMY

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.500
HOFFA DIED OF NATURAL CAUSES?

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.100
MR. SMITH: I DO NOT.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.500
SEN. KENNEDY: NOW, YOU SOUGHT

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.800
THE PHONE RECORDS OF A BUNCH OF

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.300
U.S. SENATORS, RIGHT?

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.200
MR. SMITH: WE SOUGHT THE TOLL

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.800
RECORDS, NONCONTENT RECORDS.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.800
SEN. KENNEDY: ANY DEMOCRATS OR

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.500
JUST REPUBLICANS?

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.100
MR. SMITH: IF PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.100
HAD REACHED OUT TO DEMOCRATS --

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.700
SEN. KENNEDY: I'M JUST TRYING TO

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.700
GET THE FACTS.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.600
WERE THERE ANY DEMOCRATS YOU

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.400
SOUGHT THE PHONE RECORDS?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:09.900
JUST REPUBLICANS, RIGHT?

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.100
MR. SMITH: THE TOLL RECORDS THAT

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.900
WE SOUGHT WERE RELEVANT TO THE

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.600
INVESTIGATION, AND THEY WERE

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:14.900
REPUBLICANS.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.700
SEN. KENNEDY: I'M ASKING YOU.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.200
YOU STALLED ME AGAIN, COUNSELOR,

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.300
YOU KNOW THAT.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.200
YOU SOUGHT JUST THE RECORDS OF

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:23.800
REPUBLICANS.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.200
AND YOU KNEW THAT VIOLATED THE

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.400
SPEECH AND DEBATE CLAUSE, DIDN'T

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:28.700
YOU?

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.500
MR. SMITH: THAT IS INCORRECT.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.000
WE SOUGHT TO COMPLY --

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.500
SEN. KENNEDY: DID YOU TAKE IT?

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:35.900
MR. SMITH: I'M SORRY?

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.100
SEN. KENNEDY: WERE YOU IN THE

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:41.000
QUAD PLAYING FRISBEE DURING CON

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.700
LAW IN HARVARD LAW SCHOOL?

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:45.100
MR. SMITH: I DID TAKE

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.000
CONSTITUTIONAL LAW, YES.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.100
SEN. KENNEDY: THEN YOU HAD TO

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.000
KNOW IT VIOLATED THE

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.700
SPEECH DEBATE CLAUSE.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:54.600
IN FACT, WHEN YOU WENT TO JUDGE

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.100
BOSBERG, YOU DID NOT EVEN TELL

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.100
HIM YOU WERE SEEKING THE PHONE

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.600
RECORDS OF MEMBERS OF CONGRESS,

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:00.200
DID YOU?

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.500
BECAUSE YOU KNEW HE WOULDN'T

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.200
AGREE.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.000
HE WOULD SAY, HEY, COUNSELOR,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.900
ANYBODY WHO KNOWS A LAW BOOK

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:10.900
FROM A J. CREW CATALOGUE KNOWS

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:11.600
THIS VIOLATES THE CONSTITUTION.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.700
BUT YOU DIDN'T TELL HIM, DID

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.500
YOU?

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.700
MR. SMITH: WE SOUGHT

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.700
NONDISCLOSURE ORDERS.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.200
SEN. KENNEDY: YOU DIDN'T TELL

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:21.700
HIM, DID YOU?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.000
MR. SMITH: IN SEEKING

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:24.600
NONDISCLOSURE ORDERS, WE DID

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:25.200
NOT.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.300
SEN. KENNEDY: BUT YOU'RE

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.400
UNBIASED.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:32.500
YOU HAVE NO PERSONAL FEELING.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.900
YOU MAKE ME WANT TO THROW UP IN

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.600
MY MOUTH.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:41.100
SEN. DURBIN: MR. CHAIRMAN.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:44.600
I'D LIKE TO SAY A WORD.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.600
THIS HEARING IS OF
